{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "flanger-test",
  "name": "Flanger Test",
  "description": "Oscillator through VCF and Flanger with LFO modulation.",
  "graph": {
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": "ctrl-1",
        "type": "control",
        "name": "Keyboard",
        "position": { "x": 120, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "cv": 0,
          "cvMode": "unipolar",
          "velocity": 1,
          "midiVelocity": true,
          "gate": 0,
          "glide": 0.02,
          "voices": 4
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "osc-1",
        "type": "oscillator",
        "name": "VCO",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "frequency": 220,
          "type": "sawtooth",
          "pwm": 0.5,
          "unison": 1,
          "detune": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "adsr-1",
        "type": "adsr",
        "name": "ADSR",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 320 },
        "params": {
          "attack": 0.01,
          "decay": 0.3,
          "sustain": 0.7,
          "release": 0.4
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "vcf-1",
        "type": "vcf",
        "name": "VCF",
        "position": { "x": 720, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "cutoff": 2500,
          "resonance": 0.25,
          "drive": 0.1,
          "envAmount": 0.4,
          "modAmount": 0,
          "keyTrack": 0.5,
          "model": "svf",
          "mode": "lp",
          "slope": 12
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "lfo-1",
        "type": "lfo",
        "name": "LFO",
        "position": { "x": 720, "y": 320 },
        "params": {
          "rate": 0.2,
          "depth": 0.8,
          "offset": 0,
          "shape": "sine",
          "bipolar": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "gain-1",
        "type": "gain",
        "name": "VCA",
        "position": { "x": 920, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "gain": 0.8
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "flng-1",
        "type": "flanger",
        "name": "Flanger",
        "position": { "x": 1120, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "rate": 0.25,
          "depth": 3.0,
          "feedback": 0.6,
          "mix": 0.5
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "out-1",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Main Out",
        "position": { "x": 1320, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "level": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "notes-1",
        "type": "notes",
        "name": "Info",
        "position": { "x": 1120, "y": 320 },
        "params": {
          "text": "FLANGER TEST\n\nSawtooth oscillator through VCF and Flanger.\n\n- Control keyboard -> VCO pitch + ADSR gate\n- VCO -> VCF (lowpass) -> VCA -> Flanger -> Output\n- LFO modulates VCF cutoff for slow movement\n- ADSR controls VCA amplitude\n\nFlanger settings:\n- Rate: 0.25 Hz (slow sweep)\n- Depth: 3.0 ms\n- Feedback: 0.6 (strong flanging)\n- Mix: 50%\n\nTry: increase feedback for jet-plane effect, or speed up rate for chorus-like tones."
        }
      }
    ],
    "connections": [
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "cv-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "osc-1", "portId": "pitch" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "gate" },
        "kind": "gate"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "osc-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "vcf-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "env" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "vcf-1", "portId": "env" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "lfo-1", "portId": "cv-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "vcf-1", "portId": "mod" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "env" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "gain-1", "portId": "cv" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "vcf-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "gain-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "gain-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "flng-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "flng-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "out-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      }
    ]
  }
}
